WEBVTT

00:01.042 --> 00:03.253
[teacher] Do you know
why you are all bad at math?

00:03.336 --> 00:04.838
FINAL EXAM
IN 16 DAYS

00:04.921 --> 00:06.673
It's because of reasoning.

00:07.716 --> 00:10.969
You all just memorize,
without actually learning things.

00:17.267 --> 00:18.351
Oh Beom-seok.

00:19.102 --> 00:20.645
You're walking in at the end of class?

00:21.479 --> 00:22.522
[Beom-seok] Sorry.

00:23.314 --> 00:24.232
[grunts]

00:24.315 --> 00:29.904
[teacher] Anyway, I want you all to take
time to think about why I said this today.

00:30.572 --> 00:33.324
- Class President.
- [boy 1] Attention. Bow.

00:34.534 --> 00:35.577
[class] Thank you.

00:35.660 --> 00:37.078
[sighs]

00:41.541 --> 00:42.500
Beom-seok.

00:44.753 --> 00:45.879
Are you hungover?

00:47.297 --> 00:48.548
[Jeong-chan] Beom-seok-a.

00:49.299 --> 00:50.467
Are you okay?

00:51.342 --> 00:53.344
[tense music playing]

00:55.096 --> 00:57.807
[chuckles] Does it feel like
your head's gonna burst open?

00:57.891 --> 01:00.310
[Beom-seok] Yeah, I feel so sick.

01:00.393 --> 01:02.270
[Tae-hun grunts] Aah!

01:02.979 --> 01:06.357
I don't remember what happened last night.

01:06.441 --> 01:07.400
[Jeong-chan giggles]

01:07.484 --> 01:09.652
[Tae-hun] Bro, you were
freaking hilarious yesterday.

01:09.736 --> 01:13.114
Dude, and Yong-jin?
He totally slept with that noona.

01:13.198 --> 01:15.700
- Are you serious?
- [Tae-hun] Yeah, you don't remember?

01:15.784 --> 01:17.911
[Jeong-chan chuckles]
Yeah, you even paid for his motel.

01:17.994 --> 01:19.621
- His motel?
- [both] Yeah.

01:19.704 --> 01:22.457
- [Jeong-chan] Man, this dude.
- [Tae-hun] He legit doesn't remember.

01:22.540 --> 01:24.209
[Jeong-chan] Let's go for a smoke.

01:24.292 --> 01:25.794
Hey, thanks for the drinks.

01:25.877 --> 01:28.838
[Tae-hun] Yeah, seriously.
I had a killer time yesterday.

01:29.506 --> 01:31.132
[Jeong-chan] I thought you were…

01:40.725 --> 01:42.727
["Hero" by Meego playing]

01:56.282 --> 02:01.412
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 1

02:55.633 --> 02:57.051
[Su-ho yawning]

02:57.135 --> 02:59.095
- [boy 1] Give it to me later.
- [boy 2] I can't.

02:59.179 --> 03:00.889
[Su-ho] Hey, what's our group number?

03:02.432 --> 03:03.766
- Group six.
- Cool.

03:03.850 --> 03:05.268
I call dibs on the end seat.

03:06.186 --> 03:07.770
[groans and sighs]

03:07.854 --> 03:09.856
[boys laughing and chatting]

03:12.483 --> 03:14.485
Hey, is Oh Beom not at school yet?

03:19.115 --> 03:21.451
- He's here.
- He is? Since when?

03:21.534 --> 03:23.119
[Tae-hun] Hey, Beom-seok-a.

03:23.203 --> 03:25.788
That noona was
mad groping your thigh yesterday.

03:25.872 --> 03:26.915
[laughter]

03:29.751 --> 03:31.753
- [Jeong-chan] Oh.
- [Tae-hun] Have you talked to her?

03:31.836 --> 03:35.256
- [Su-ho] What the hell?
- You were rapping so much at karaoke.

03:35.340 --> 03:37.258
- In English too.
- [Tae-hun] We were like, "What?"

03:37.342 --> 03:39.928
You must've had a lot of anger to get out.
We should go again.

03:40.011 --> 03:42.096
- [Jeong-chan] Yeah, without Yong-jin.
- [Tae-hun] Yeah.

03:42.180 --> 03:44.474
You made everything happen,
but Yong-jin stole your thunder.

03:44.557 --> 03:45.725
Uh-huh. Like, right…

03:48.186 --> 03:49.437
Can we talk for a sec?

03:50.230 --> 03:51.481
[Jeong-chan sighs]

03:54.108 --> 03:55.318
[Si-eun] What's with you?

03:56.611 --> 03:57.946
[Beom-seok] What about me?

03:59.614 --> 04:01.241
Why won't you answer my calls?

04:02.325 --> 04:03.284
What?

04:04.953 --> 04:06.204
I didn't know you called.

04:09.332 --> 04:10.541
What's going on?

04:11.834 --> 04:15.213
Why are you suddenly friends with them?
Jeong-chan and Tae-hun?

04:17.465 --> 04:18.591
[sighs]

04:20.760 --> 04:22.220
That's none of your business.

04:28.434 --> 04:30.812
You, me and Su-ho should talk things out.

04:30.895 --> 04:32.689
[sighs] I have nothing to say.

04:32.772 --> 04:34.357
[poignant music playing]

04:37.485 --> 04:39.904
He's looked down on me
since the moment we met.

04:41.281 --> 04:43.533
He's never even thought of me
as a friend to begin with.

04:43.616 --> 04:46.828
He probably just thought of me
as his minion who just tags along.

04:53.668 --> 04:54.585
[sighs]

04:58.339 --> 05:00.091
- [Su-ho] Talking shit?
- [sighs]

05:00.925 --> 05:03.136
You're really pathetic, you know that?

05:10.685 --> 05:12.312
What are you gonna do about it?

05:14.731 --> 05:15.982
[sighs]

05:28.911 --> 05:30.913
[techno music playing]

05:38.212 --> 05:40.673
[girls chant] Drink it all, drink it all!

05:40.757 --> 05:42.175
[all] Whoo!

05:42.258 --> 05:44.218
- [girl 1] Whoo, whoo!
- [girl 2] Wow, he's good.

05:44.302 --> 05:46.512
- [girl 1] Ooh!
- [Jeong-chan] Ah!

05:46.596 --> 05:48.431
- Got a bottle for me too?
- [girl 1] What's up?

05:48.514 --> 05:49.515
[Yeong-bin] Oh Beom-seok.

05:50.558 --> 05:51.559
It's been a while.

05:53.728 --> 05:55.730
Yeah, it's been a while.

05:56.731 --> 05:59.108
- Come, sit here.
- [Tae-hun] Over here, Beom-seok-a.

06:06.741 --> 06:09.327
Oh Beom-seok's a friend,
from my old school.

06:09.410 --> 06:10.745
His dad's Assemblyman Oh Jin-won.

06:10.828 --> 06:13.456
- [girl 2] Who's that?
- [girl 3] You know, that assemblyman.

06:14.457 --> 06:15.541
You know who that is.

06:15.625 --> 06:18.294
- [girl 1] Oh, seriously? That's awesome!
- [girl 2] Wow.

06:18.378 --> 06:20.463
[Yeong-bin] This is Seo-hyeon,
Ji-an, and Su-a.

06:21.214 --> 06:22.715
Friends from my new school.

06:22.799 --> 06:26.302
This is Kang Woo-yeong,
my friend who'll make it to UFC.

06:26.386 --> 06:28.012
[Woo-yeong chuckles] Uh-huh.

06:28.096 --> 06:30.723
- You know Physical Therapist Woo-yeong?
- What?

06:30.807 --> 06:33.559
- Um, physical therapy?
- [Yeong-bin] Watch it later.

06:33.643 --> 06:37.105
It's his channel where he spars with
these idiots who think they're strong.

06:37.188 --> 06:38.523
Freaking hilarious.

06:39.107 --> 06:40.316
Nice to meet ya.

06:42.402 --> 06:44.195
Yeah, nice to meet you too.

06:47.657 --> 06:48.741
[Yeong-bin] Oh, right.

06:48.825 --> 06:51.285
You're not friends with
Si-eun and Su-ho anymore?

06:53.162 --> 06:54.872
- Uh-huh.
- [Yeong-bin] What happened?

06:54.956 --> 06:56.624
You guys were pretty tight.

06:58.334 --> 07:00.962
Ahn Su-ho freaking thinks
he's, like, king of the world.

07:01.546 --> 07:03.798
Ahn Su-ho's so full of himself.

07:05.007 --> 07:06.717
He thinks everyone is beneath him.

07:07.927 --> 07:10.138
I need to kick his fucking ass someday.

07:13.099 --> 07:13.975
Whatever.

07:15.059 --> 07:16.310
I'm sorry about before.

07:22.233 --> 07:23.234
Let's make a toast.

07:23.317 --> 07:24.277
[Tae-hun] Bottoms up!

07:24.360 --> 07:25.945
[all] Cheers!

07:26.028 --> 07:26.988
[girls] Whoo!

07:27.071 --> 07:28.906
[Jeong-chan] I wanna transfer schools too.

07:28.990 --> 07:30.533
[Tae-hun chuckles]

07:30.616 --> 07:32.869
[Seo-hyeon giggles] Isn't he your type?

07:33.744 --> 07:37.206
[teacher] "Some experts…"
A few select specialists.

07:37.331 --> 07:41.127
"…estimated…"
They guessed and approximated something.

07:41.711 --> 07:45.590
DAESUNG ACADEMY

07:48.134 --> 07:49.677
[Su-ho] Hey, Si-eun-ssi!

07:56.559 --> 07:57.602
[sighs]

07:58.102 --> 07:59.896
Aah. Ah.

08:01.189 --> 08:03.399
- What's up?
- [Su-ho] What do you think?

08:03.483 --> 08:05.943
It's Friday night.
Let's go drive around tonight.

08:06.027 --> 08:07.528
Hmm? Hop on.

08:17.747 --> 08:19.165
Cute. Mm-hmm.

08:19.248 --> 08:20.750
[quirky music playing]

08:20.833 --> 08:22.251
[motorcycle engine starts]

08:31.469 --> 08:32.512
[Su-ho sighs]

08:41.187 --> 08:42.313
Aah.

08:44.690 --> 08:48.361
Unit 909. Mmm. Think of this as part
of your training and go take the stairs.

08:50.655 --> 08:52.865
- You're making me work?
- Bro, I wouldn't do that.

08:52.949 --> 08:55.076
I'm just trying to help you
get in shape, that's all.

08:57.411 --> 09:00.039
- [starts engine]
- I gotta make a stop over there.

09:05.878 --> 09:06.837
[Su-ho] Hey, cheers.

09:11.133 --> 09:13.386
[groans] It's good, right?

09:14.804 --> 09:15.805
[Si-eun] Aah…

09:16.305 --> 09:17.348
[Su-ho chuckles]

09:20.393 --> 09:21.686
Aah.

09:24.855 --> 09:27.692
Oh, yeah. Is Yeong-i doing good at work?

09:28.276 --> 09:30.945
Yeah. She's actually
pretty good at it, man.

09:31.028 --> 09:32.613
She's great with the customers.

09:37.660 --> 09:38.869
[joints crack]

09:38.953 --> 09:39.954
[sighs]

09:40.997 --> 09:42.081
It seems like…

09:44.458 --> 09:47.086
Jeong-chan and Tae-hun are taking
advantage of Beom-seok.

09:48.212 --> 09:49.130
[Su-ho sniffles]

09:50.423 --> 09:51.340
And?

09:52.967 --> 09:55.636
I think he's been buying them
clothes and shoes too.

09:56.929 --> 09:59.307
And they've been saying
he pays for all the drinks.

10:01.225 --> 10:02.852
And he's been reeking of alcohol.

10:05.313 --> 10:07.315
What if Oh Beom's taking
advantage of them?

10:10.860 --> 10:11.902
I think

10:12.403 --> 10:14.780
that's what that guy's been wanting
from the beginning.

10:15.990 --> 10:20.077
He first latched onto me and you
because he wanted to be popular.

10:22.955 --> 10:25.207
He built up some cred hanging out with us.

10:27.335 --> 10:28.461
[sighs]

10:30.671 --> 10:31.922
You really think that?

10:37.470 --> 10:38.512
[grunts]

10:42.141 --> 10:43.225
[sighs]

10:43.309 --> 10:45.311
[laughter]

10:47.021 --> 10:50.399
- [boy 1] You guys have fun this weekend?
- Yeong-bin brought some pretty girls.

10:50.483 --> 10:52.026
- You freaking traitors.
- [boy 2] Hey.

10:52.526 --> 10:54.111
- What about us?
- I'm gonna date her.

10:54.195 --> 10:55.196
[boy 2] Seriously?

10:55.279 --> 10:57.823
Stop living in your imagination,
you idiot.

10:57.907 --> 11:00.785
It's true love.
And she looks at me in a certain way.

11:00.868 --> 11:02.578
She can't believe
you're a high school kid.

11:02.662 --> 11:03.996
You look like an elementary kid.

11:04.080 --> 11:05.373
- [boy 1] Fight him!
- Let's fight.

11:05.456 --> 11:06.957
Hey, come and get it.

11:07.708 --> 11:09.710
Seo-hyeon's been keeping in touch with me.

11:09.794 --> 11:11.170
- Get outta here.
- [boy 1] Who?

11:11.253 --> 11:12.546
Yeah, fuckin' right!

11:12.630 --> 11:14.840
- [boy 3] What's she look like?
- I'm serious. We're DMing.

11:14.924 --> 11:17.134
- No way.
- She messaged me first and wants to meet.

11:17.218 --> 11:18.386
- [Tae-hun] For real?
- Mm-hmm.

11:18.469 --> 11:20.179
- [boy 2] Yeah, right.
- [boy 1] What about us?

11:20.262 --> 11:22.056
- [boy 3] Me too.
- Everyone except you. [laughs]

11:22.139 --> 11:24.016
- I believe you!
- [Tae-hun] Ask her to bring Su-a.

11:24.100 --> 11:25.434
- All right.
- I wanna come too!

11:25.518 --> 11:27.061
- I'll DM her.
- I like Ji-an. No, wait.

11:27.144 --> 11:28.479
- Not Ji-an.
- Tell her about us too.

11:28.562 --> 11:30.272
- [Tae-hun] I want Su-a.
- Let's not be greedy.

11:30.356 --> 11:32.942
- What about us?
- [boy 1] Her profile picture is hot!

11:34.151 --> 11:35.569
- Come on, do it.
- [Tae-hun] Hurry.

11:35.653 --> 11:37.697
- I'll message her later.
- [boy 2] Aw, man, just do it!

11:37.780 --> 11:40.282
- [Tae-hun] I'm serious.
- [Jeong-chan] Beom-seok, you moving over?

11:40.366 --> 11:43.411
- [boy 1] I'm drawing its head first.
- [Jeong-chan] Seriously, dude?

11:43.911 --> 11:45.371
[boy 2] I can start drawing its body.

11:45.454 --> 11:47.289
[tense music playing]

11:52.795 --> 11:54.755
- [Tae-hun] Hurry up, dude.
- [Jeong-chan] Annoying.

11:54.839 --> 11:55.965
[Beom-seok] Is it Su-a again?

11:56.048 --> 11:58.217
- [Jeong-chan] Always.
- [Tae-hun] Please ask Su-a to come.

11:58.300 --> 12:01.554
- [Jeong-chan] Isn't this seat great?
- [Beom-seok] Yeah, I love this seat.

12:01.637 --> 12:04.473
[Jeong-chan scoffs]
A hundred million won per pyeong.

12:04.557 --> 12:06.517
[sighs] You have to treat us big time.

12:06.600 --> 12:08.644
- [Beom-seok] For sure, this weekend.
- [Tae-hun] Cool.

12:09.770 --> 12:11.063
[Beom-seok] But not Tae-hun.

12:11.147 --> 12:12.565
[Tae-hun] I'm not going, then.

12:12.648 --> 12:14.859
[Jeong-chan] Hey, hey, guys.
We need to be a team.

12:16.402 --> 12:17.820
Stop treating him like that.

12:18.446 --> 12:19.321
What?

12:20.781 --> 12:22.450
You're using Beom-seok.

12:22.533 --> 12:25.786
- Ah, jeez.
- What the hell are you saying, dude?

12:26.370 --> 12:28.873
School's turning into
a pretty scary place.

12:28.956 --> 12:31.333
You've been making Beom-seok
pay for everything.

12:32.168 --> 12:33.669
He's been buying your shoes and drinks.

12:33.753 --> 12:36.046
This guy's fucking making us the bad guy.

12:36.130 --> 12:37.047
Hey.

12:37.548 --> 12:39.675
He offered to buy us all that stuff, dude.

12:41.761 --> 12:43.179
I've made myself clear.

12:45.681 --> 12:46.807
[Tae-hun sighs]

12:55.816 --> 12:57.276
Hey, let's grab a bite.

13:13.918 --> 13:15.461
Stop worrying about Beom-seok.

13:17.713 --> 13:18.881
What?

13:19.423 --> 13:21.342
You've done enough for that guy.

13:26.388 --> 13:27.932
I think Beom-seok…

13:30.392 --> 13:31.977
did all that because he's lonely.

13:35.189 --> 13:36.816
I don't have the right words,

13:38.150 --> 13:39.443
but that's how I feel.

13:42.530 --> 13:43.614
[boy 1] Up for b-ball later?

13:43.697 --> 13:46.033
- [Tae-hun] Nah.
- What's for lunch? I'm starving.

13:46.116 --> 13:48.077
Man, gaenip? Fuck.

13:48.160 --> 13:49.870
Who wants to help me unstick mine?

13:54.750 --> 13:55.626
Hey.

14:00.214 --> 14:01.298
Hey!

14:07.513 --> 14:09.557
- Get in line.
- [boy 2] What are they doing?

14:09.640 --> 14:10.599
You just cut.

14:11.684 --> 14:12.810
[sighs]

14:13.435 --> 14:15.437
[tense music playing]

14:19.233 --> 14:21.151
[students gasping]

14:21.902 --> 14:23.195
[boy 3] Oh my God!

14:23.863 --> 14:24.947
[Su-ho] Get in line.

14:25.030 --> 14:26.156
[clang]

14:26.240 --> 14:28.325
- [clattering]
- [Su-ho] Damn it!

14:28.409 --> 14:30.160
[boy 1] Come on. Let's get in line.

14:46.552 --> 14:47.678
[sighs]

14:54.268 --> 14:55.853
[sighs]

14:59.106 --> 15:00.065
[sighs]

15:05.446 --> 15:08.073
[sighs] I'm over this.

15:11.660 --> 15:12.870
[sighs]

15:14.121 --> 15:15.539
Get in line, Beom-seok-a.

15:19.585 --> 15:20.836
[Beom-seok sighs]

15:25.507 --> 15:26.592
No, thanks.

15:35.601 --> 15:37.311
[students gasping]

15:38.646 --> 15:39.688
That's enough.

15:39.772 --> 15:41.148
[clattering]

15:41.231 --> 15:43.233
[students murmuring]

15:47.655 --> 15:48.822
[boy 4] Oh shit.

15:48.906 --> 15:50.950
[boy 3] Oh my God.

15:51.033 --> 15:54.036
- [boy 2] Did you see that?
- [boy 5] How is he taking them all on?

15:54.119 --> 15:56.080
- How does he do that?
- [boy 2] What are they doing?

15:58.582 --> 16:00.250
[boy 3] Oh shit.

16:08.801 --> 16:10.803
- [Jeong-chan] Let's go.
- [Tae-hun] You okay, dude?

16:10.886 --> 16:12.304
[Jeong-chan] Fuck that dude.

16:21.605 --> 16:22.856
[music fades]

16:23.607 --> 16:24.733
[Tae-hun] Fuck this, man.

16:24.817 --> 16:27.736
That asshole thinks
everyone's freaking beneath him.

16:27.820 --> 16:29.238
- Fuck.
- [boy 1 sighs]

16:31.865 --> 16:33.367
[sighs] Hey.

16:35.035 --> 16:36.954
Do you know anybody
who could kick his ass?

16:37.454 --> 16:38.664
- What?
- [Beom-seok] I'll pay.

16:38.747 --> 16:41.125
Do you know anybody
who could kill that asshole?

16:43.544 --> 16:45.462
I do. Fuck!

16:45.546 --> 16:47.256
- [Tae-hun] What?
- Woo-yeong.

16:48.340 --> 16:51.802
Hey, I watched his videos.
He's a freakin' great fighter.

16:53.679 --> 16:56.056
PHYSICAL THERAPIST WOO-YEONG

16:56.140 --> 16:58.142
[Jeong-chan] Right?
This might fucking work. Huh?

16:58.225 --> 16:59.268
[boy 1] He's strong.

16:59.351 --> 17:00.769
[hits landing]

17:01.687 --> 17:03.188
[Tae-hun] He throws good punches.

17:06.650 --> 17:08.068
[Woo-yeong] How much will you pay?

17:12.531 --> 17:13.532
[clears throat]

17:14.033 --> 17:15.617
Would a million won be enough?

17:23.834 --> 17:24.835
What day?

17:29.673 --> 17:30.924
This coming Saturday.

17:33.469 --> 17:34.803
It's Su-ho's birthday.

17:37.306 --> 17:38.307
[Woo-yeong] Okay, sure.

17:40.225 --> 17:42.352
I'll stream the whole thing live,
no edits.

17:48.192 --> 17:49.902
- Where you going?
- To work out.

17:51.153 --> 17:52.654
[Yeong-bin] That's dedication.

17:55.240 --> 17:56.200
Wait a sec.

17:57.534 --> 18:01.246
Didn't Woo-yeong get knocked out
by Su-ho before? In a tournament?

18:01.955 --> 18:03.665
[Jeong-chan] That was forever ago.

18:04.249 --> 18:06.710
That guy's still fighting,
but Su-ho's been hangin' out.

18:07.211 --> 18:09.004
- Come on.
- [Yeong-bin] Hey.

18:10.172 --> 18:12.508
Give him a handicap,
if you're so worried about it.

18:16.261 --> 18:17.596
Am I wrong?

18:17.679 --> 18:19.932
[all laugh]

18:29.149 --> 18:30.192
Delivery!

18:34.947 --> 18:36.949
[suspenseful music playing]

18:45.541 --> 18:46.792
[clicking]

18:48.252 --> 18:50.003
Hey, is this it?

18:51.839 --> 18:54.424
[Jeong-chan] Yeah, I think so. Hold on.

18:54.508 --> 18:57.719
- I'll do it. Fuck. Whatever.
- [Tae-hun] Can you hurry?

18:57.803 --> 18:59.263
- [rattling]
- It's hard to cut off.

18:59.346 --> 19:00.806
Darn it. Ugh.

19:00.889 --> 19:02.432
Dang it. [grunts]

19:02.516 --> 19:04.268
- [air hissing]
- [Jeong-chan grunts]

19:04.351 --> 19:07.312
- Damn, I hope it's right.
- [Tae-hun] Ah, fuck.

19:07.396 --> 19:09.022
What if he really dies?

19:09.606 --> 19:11.358
[Jeong-chan] Then he fucking dies.

19:23.453 --> 19:25.455
[clicking]

19:28.000 --> 19:28.834
Oh, fuck.

19:29.334 --> 19:31.378
- [clicking]
- Whoa.

19:31.461 --> 19:34.423
- [tires screeching]
- [horns blaring]

19:34.506 --> 19:35.799
[Su-ho] Whoa. Whoa!

19:42.055 --> 19:44.349
- [horn beeping]
- [Su-ho] Move. Move!

19:45.767 --> 19:47.019
[yelps]

19:47.603 --> 19:48.478
[woman screams]

19:49.229 --> 19:50.814
[onlookers gasping]

19:57.112 --> 19:59.198
[man 1] Are you okay? Huh?

19:59.698 --> 20:02.201
- Someone call an ambulance.
- She's calling them right now.

20:02.784 --> 20:04.494
- Can you move?
- [woman 2] Do you know him?

20:05.037 --> 20:07.831
[Yeong-bin] Hey, let's go.
Or else we'll seriously be fucked.

20:07.915 --> 20:09.917
[tense music playing]

20:13.086 --> 20:15.797
- [Jeong-chan] Hey, Beom-seok.
- [Tae-hun] Hey, hurry up.

20:28.769 --> 20:31.688
- [man 1] You're okay?
- [Su-ho] I'm fine. I'm all right.

20:31.772 --> 20:34.358
- [man 1] That's a relief.
- [man 2] Shouldn't he go see a doctor?

20:35.150 --> 20:36.109
[music fades]

20:36.193 --> 20:39.154
What did I tell you all
about "Cheongsan Byeolgok"?

20:46.495 --> 20:47.621
Did you just get here?

20:49.081 --> 20:50.082
[Su-ho] I'm sorry.

20:51.667 --> 20:53.835
- [teacher] Eyes in front. Eyes in front!
- [Su-ho sighs]

20:55.504 --> 20:57.965
[teacher] Let me break this down
for you one last time.

20:58.048 --> 20:58.924
[sighs]

20:59.007 --> 21:02.844
[teacher] It has a three-part harmony,
split into different verses with a chorus.

21:02.928 --> 21:04.638
This is a song that represents

21:04.721 --> 21:07.849
the universal characteristics
of Goryeo songs…

21:07.933 --> 21:09.184
[teacher's voice fades]

21:09.268 --> 21:10.477
[tense music playing]

21:21.530 --> 21:22.614
[music fades]

21:23.240 --> 21:25.117
[boy 1] Hey, dude. Come on, let's go.

21:26.910 --> 21:30.080
- What happened to your leg?
- It's no big deal. Hmm.

21:31.999 --> 21:33.083
Hey.

21:36.920 --> 21:38.338
Stop staring.

21:40.048 --> 21:41.425
You disgust me.

21:44.261 --> 21:45.262
Fuck off.

21:51.435 --> 21:52.561
What's that?

21:54.229 --> 21:55.272
It's nothing.

22:03.947 --> 22:06.241
[Jeong-chan] Oh, fuck.
That legit scared me.

22:06.992 --> 22:09.161
[Tae-hun] Do you think he knows it was us?

22:09.244 --> 22:11.204
[Jeong-chan] No way. How would he know?

22:11.288 --> 22:13.457
[Tae-hun] He doesn't, right?
Yeah, there's no way.

22:13.540 --> 22:15.625
[Jeong-chan] So, Ahn Su-ho's
birthday is in two days?

22:15.709 --> 22:17.210
[lively pop music playing]

22:17.294 --> 22:18.712
[Yeong-i] Cool, I'm done.

22:19.212 --> 22:20.339
Okay.

22:21.590 --> 22:24.885
[sighs] Ahn Su-ho.
We'd be in Yangyang without that accident.

22:25.427 --> 22:27.429
[sighs] Take some pictures.

22:29.431 --> 22:30.515
Make me look pretty.

22:31.975 --> 22:34.144
People will see this
and think it's your birthday.

22:39.232 --> 22:40.484
Hurry up and take it.

22:45.113 --> 22:46.740
[boy 1] Okay, and down.

22:47.366 --> 22:49.242
Come on. One more. Hurry!

22:49.326 --> 22:50.410
Good job.

22:51.745 --> 22:52.913
[phone bleeps]

22:52.996 --> 22:54.539
[ringing tone]

22:58.960 --> 23:00.170
[ringing tone continues]

23:00.253 --> 23:01.713
[typing]

23:04.299 --> 23:05.384
Not answering?

23:05.467 --> 23:06.676
[boy 1] Come on.

23:06.760 --> 23:08.595
- No.
- [boy 1] Hold on for a second.

23:11.473 --> 23:13.392
That bastard probably blocked your number.

23:13.475 --> 23:16.395
Your call cannot be completed as dialed.

23:16.478 --> 23:17.771
- [boy 2 grunts]
- [boy 1] Nice!

23:23.568 --> 23:25.028
Cool, bro. Take five.

23:25.112 --> 23:26.113
What is it?

23:26.696 --> 23:28.198
[boy 1] Up, up. Come on!

23:29.324 --> 23:30.867
- Nothing.
- [boy 1] Higher!

23:37.124 --> 23:41.211
[Yeong-i] I mean, it'll take, like,
half an hour for Su-ho to get here.

23:41.878 --> 23:44.005
Why are you making miyeok-guk already?

23:44.756 --> 23:46.883
The longer it boils, the better it tastes.

23:48.135 --> 23:49.386
[scoffs] Who told you that?

23:49.469 --> 23:51.054
MY BUDDY SI-EUN, LOOK HERE

23:52.055 --> 23:54.933
BEOM-SEOK: ARE YOU AT THE PARTY ROOM?

23:58.645 --> 24:00.355
ARE YOU AT THE PARTY ROOM?

24:00.439 --> 24:03.150
I'M NEARBY. CAN I SEE YOU A MINUTE?

24:04.443 --> 24:05.527
Hey.

24:06.236 --> 24:08.488
Aren't you guys not friends
with Beom-seok?

24:12.742 --> 24:13.952
[Si-eun] Did Su-ho say that?

24:14.035 --> 24:15.579
IT'S SU-HO'S BIRTHDAY TODAY.

24:15.662 --> 24:16.955
No, he didn't.

24:18.373 --> 24:21.042
Why do you ask about Beom-seok?

24:21.960 --> 24:23.962
DON'T TELL SI-EUN OR SU-HO.

24:24.045 --> 24:26.673
COME OUT FOR A MINUTE
SO I CAN GIVE YOU HIS PRESENT.

24:31.178 --> 24:33.180
Huh? No reason.

24:33.263 --> 24:34.139
Ah…

24:34.848 --> 24:36.808
I'm gonna run to the convenience store.

24:39.978 --> 24:41.271
[door opens]

24:41.354 --> 24:42.564
[door closes]

24:42.647 --> 24:43.690
[jazz playing]

24:43.773 --> 24:45.025
[shop bell rings]

24:45.984 --> 24:47.402
[Yeong-i] It's been a while.

24:48.278 --> 24:49.446
You've been good?

24:51.656 --> 24:52.824
[Beom-seok] Yeah, sure.

24:55.577 --> 24:56.620
You've been good?

24:57.412 --> 25:00.040
Hey, sorry about before.

25:01.750 --> 25:04.503
I heard you got in trouble
'cause I answered your phone.

25:05.629 --> 25:07.672
Si-eun's been really worried about you.

25:09.007 --> 25:12.385
You should come to the party.
Su-ho's on his way there.

25:12.969 --> 25:14.513
I'll help you two make up.

25:21.853 --> 25:23.021
Hey.

25:24.064 --> 25:25.232
First of all,

25:26.233 --> 25:27.734
I wasn't in any trouble.

25:27.817 --> 25:29.444
[tense music playing]

25:30.028 --> 25:31.404
You'll help us make up?

25:32.697 --> 25:33.657
[Yeong-i] Hmm?

25:34.950 --> 25:37.619
I'm not interested
in making up with Su-ho.

25:40.664 --> 25:41.498
[laughs]

25:43.583 --> 25:44.626
[exhales]

25:53.468 --> 25:55.720
- [Yeong-i] What the hell?
- [laughs]

26:01.017 --> 26:02.310
[Su-ho] You can't go there.

26:02.811 --> 26:05.689
[sighs] You're not supposed to plan
when you play. Hey, look, look.

26:05.772 --> 26:08.358
Don't treat gaming like you're studying.
Okay?

26:08.817 --> 26:10.902
Ugh. Give me that.

26:12.279 --> 26:13.321
[sighs]

26:15.490 --> 26:18.201
Anyway, is Yeong-i crawling
her way back? Huh?

26:18.285 --> 26:19.953
What's taking her so long? I'm starving.

26:21.746 --> 26:24.708
We can bring out the cake later.
Or should we just eat first?

26:29.004 --> 26:30.130
Seriously?

26:31.965 --> 26:35.010
That's a brilliant idea, bud.
Sounds like a plan.

26:36.678 --> 26:37.721
Aah.

26:37.804 --> 26:39.889
- I'll give Yeong-i a call.
- [Su-ho] Okay.

26:42.017 --> 26:43.560
- [sighs]
- [dishes clattering]

26:45.812 --> 26:46.855
[bleep]

26:46.938 --> 26:48.857
The device is turned off.

26:48.940 --> 26:51.443
- You will be redirected to voicemail…
- [Su-ho humming]

26:51.526 --> 26:54.029
You know that cold pizza
tastes amazing when it's reheated?

26:54.112 --> 26:56.364
You're in for a surprise.
You better be ready.

26:56.448 --> 26:57.991
- [phone buzzes]
- [bleeping]

26:58.074 --> 26:59.743
[microwave whirring]

27:04.664 --> 27:05.790
[phone buzzes]

27:07.417 --> 27:09.002
[microwave bleeps]

27:09.753 --> 27:10.920
[dishes clink]

27:12.422 --> 27:14.424
BEOM-SEOK:
18-3 BAMGOGAE-RO, GANGNAM, SEOUL

27:14.507 --> 27:16.968
STOP IGNORING MY CALLS AND GET OVER HERE

27:17.052 --> 27:19.054
[microwave whirring]

27:20.722 --> 27:21.973
[suspenseful music playing]

27:24.643 --> 27:27.062
Stop staring. You disgust me.

27:28.438 --> 27:29.356
[microwave bleeps]

27:29.439 --> 27:31.733
[Su-ho] Hey, don't bother
with Yeong-i right now.

27:31.816 --> 27:34.486
Hey. Aren't you guys
not friends with Beom-seok?

27:34.569 --> 27:36.696
I'm gonna run to the convenience store.

27:37.572 --> 27:39.115
[Su-ho] Hey, come sit. Quick.

27:39.866 --> 27:42.118
This smells amazing! Fuck, man.

27:44.162 --> 27:45.288
YOUR BIRTHDAY PRESENT LOL

27:45.372 --> 27:47.624
[Su-ho] Hey, this cheese is freaking…

27:47.707 --> 27:49.709
Yes! [slurping]

27:49.793 --> 27:50.919
Mmm.

27:51.878 --> 27:52.754
The cheese!

27:52.837 --> 27:54.047
You eat first.

27:56.132 --> 27:57.967
Okay. Mmm.

27:59.344 --> 28:03.598
Oh, I really wanna eat the fried chicken,
but I'll wait, okay? Aah!

28:04.182 --> 28:06.768
ON MY WAY. WAIT FOR ME

28:09.020 --> 28:10.605
DELETE 6 MESSAGES

28:12.691 --> 28:14.025
BEOM-SEOK IS BLOCKED

28:14.693 --> 28:15.944
SLIDE TO POWER OFF

28:23.868 --> 28:27.205
- I have to run to the store real quick.
- [Su-ho] Right now? Hey.

28:31.626 --> 28:32.627
Hurry up.

28:33.336 --> 28:35.588
Five minutes is all you get. I mean it.

28:37.424 --> 28:38.425
I'll be right back.

28:39.050 --> 28:40.051
Go ahead and eat.

28:44.305 --> 28:45.348
[door closes]

28:51.938 --> 28:54.524
[Yeong-i sighs] I wanna smoke so bad.

28:56.609 --> 28:57.527
[sighs]

28:58.027 --> 28:59.904
Su-ho never even answered my calls.

29:00.405 --> 29:02.657
I sent a photo of you,
and he's on his way.

29:03.199 --> 29:04.617
[Yeong-i] Shut your mouth.

29:05.118 --> 29:06.786
Your breath smells like shit.

29:06.870 --> 29:08.788
[Yeong-bin laughs]

29:13.042 --> 29:15.670
Hey, I've got a question for ya.

29:16.254 --> 29:17.589
Are you and Ahn Su-ho dating?

29:17.672 --> 29:19.716
[sighs] The hell are you on about?

29:19.799 --> 29:24.512
It makes sense. Relationships are
a give-and-take sort of thing, right?

29:24.596 --> 29:27.265
You didn't have a home,
so he let you crash at his place

29:27.348 --> 29:28.808
and found you a part-time job.

29:28.892 --> 29:30.185
[scoffs]

29:30.268 --> 29:32.395
I want to know
what you gave him in return.

29:33.188 --> 29:34.564
[Yeong-i] What a load of crap.

29:35.899 --> 29:37.650
[ominous music playing]

29:59.047 --> 30:00.507
[clattering]

30:07.931 --> 30:09.557
[Si-eun] The Battle of Thermopylae.

30:10.767 --> 30:13.853
Spartans were outnumbered,
so they fought in a narrow pass

30:14.687 --> 30:16.439
to overcome their enemy.

30:19.234 --> 30:22.904
In a one-against-many fight,
you must make good use of the terrain.

30:38.628 --> 30:41.172
[Yeong-bin] What shall we get
to eat after this?

30:42.131 --> 30:44.092
[Jeong-chan] I don't know.
Maybe jjajangmyeon?

30:44.759 --> 30:47.262
[Tae-hun] Maybe jjamppong or jjajangmyeon.

30:49.264 --> 30:50.765
[Yeong-bin] Jjamppong all the way.

30:50.849 --> 30:53.059
[Tae-hun] I feel like
I'm kinda in the middle.

30:53.142 --> 30:55.395
[Jeong-chan] Jjajangmyeon wins every time.

30:56.604 --> 30:59.315
- [Tae-hun] It depends on my mood.
- [Yeong-bin] Always jjamppong.

30:59.399 --> 31:00.733
What the hell?

31:03.862 --> 31:05.947
- [Tae-hun] Look who showed.
- Si-eun-a.

31:07.031 --> 31:08.241
[Jeong-chan] What?

31:08.825 --> 31:10.577
- [boy 1] What the fuck?
- [Yeong-bin] Wow!

31:10.660 --> 31:12.495
It's been
a fucking long time, Yeon Si-eun.

31:13.413 --> 31:15.290
[Yeong-i] What happened? Where's Su-ho?

31:15.373 --> 31:17.709
[Yeong-bin] It's so fucking nice
to see you.

31:18.293 --> 31:19.961
- [Si-eun] Let's go.
- [Yeong-i] What? [gasps]

31:20.712 --> 31:23.548
- [Tae-hun] Oh, fuck this! Fuck! Fuck!
- [Yeong-bin] Get them! Go!

31:24.883 --> 31:27.385
What? Where's Ahn Su-ho?

31:27.468 --> 31:29.470
[dramatic music playing]

31:31.306 --> 31:32.765
[Yeong-i] Oh, shit! [sobs]

31:34.183 --> 31:35.184
[Tae-hun] Fuck!

31:35.768 --> 31:37.687
- [yells]
- [Yeong-i gasps]

31:37.770 --> 31:40.189
- [Tae-hun groans] Fuck.
- [Si-eun] Get outta here!

31:40.273 --> 31:41.941
- [groans]
- [clattering]

31:42.025 --> 31:42.984
I'll get the police!

31:43.067 --> 31:44.319
[boys grunting]

31:46.613 --> 31:47.697
[Tae-hun] Son of a bitch.

31:49.449 --> 31:50.533
[Yeong-bin] Hurry up and go!

31:50.617 --> 31:52.285
- [boy 1] Fuck, dude.
- Get them, damn it!

31:52.869 --> 31:54.370
Can you get here right away?

31:54.454 --> 31:56.831
[whimpering] They're gonna
fuck us up really bad!

31:56.915 --> 32:00.460
- [boy 1] Hey! Damn it. Shit!
- Yeah. They're coming after me right now!

32:00.543 --> 32:02.503
- [boy 2] Stop, fucking asshole!
- [Tae-hun] Get him.

32:02.587 --> 32:04.047
[Jeong-chan] Yeon Si-eun!

32:04.130 --> 32:05.632
Damn it! [grunts]

32:08.843 --> 32:09.761
Hey! Prick!

32:14.474 --> 32:15.558
Hey!

32:15.642 --> 32:17.310
- Oh shit!
- Oh shit.

32:19.354 --> 32:20.730
[yelps]

32:21.522 --> 32:22.941
This motherfucker.

32:23.024 --> 32:25.276
[Si-eun panting]

32:29.864 --> 32:30.823
Shithead.

32:31.950 --> 32:32.951
[wrench clatters]

32:36.454 --> 32:38.247
- [grunts]
- [Yeong-bin] What the fuck?

32:39.374 --> 32:40.500
Fuck, man!

32:41.209 --> 32:43.127
- [yelps]
- [crowbar clatters]

32:43.211 --> 32:45.588
- [Yeong-bin groans]
- [paint can clatters]

32:52.720 --> 32:54.597
Hey. Hey, wait a minute.

32:56.766 --> 32:57.725
Wait.

32:57.809 --> 32:59.018
Hey, wait a minute.

32:59.894 --> 33:01.729
- Damn it.
- [Woo-yeong] Hey, looking great!

33:01.813 --> 33:02.897
[sighs]

33:06.901 --> 33:09.320
What's this about? Where's Ahn Su-ho?

33:09.904 --> 33:11.447
[tense music playing]

33:16.119 --> 33:17.954
Are you Yeong-bin's friend?

33:22.291 --> 33:23.876
[Woo-yeong] A weapon won't help you much.

33:30.925 --> 33:32.427
[Tae-hun] Oh shit!

33:35.138 --> 33:37.140
[Si-eun grunting]

33:42.895 --> 33:43.980
[coughs]

33:44.772 --> 33:45.606
[gasps]

33:46.274 --> 33:48.693
Using a weapon? You son of a bitch!

33:50.403 --> 33:52.447
Ugh, what a little coward.

33:52.947 --> 33:53.906
[Si-eun coughs]

34:03.082 --> 34:04.000
[groans]

34:05.668 --> 34:06.961
[Beom-seok] That's enough.

34:07.045 --> 34:08.546
[music fades]

34:11.174 --> 34:12.258
Let him leave.

34:14.552 --> 34:15.428
What?

34:15.511 --> 34:17.972
He has nothing to do with this.
I want Ahn Su-ho.

34:18.973 --> 34:21.642
- Just let Si-eun leave.
- Sounds like a you problem.

34:23.603 --> 34:25.229
I have something to settle with Si-eun.

34:31.277 --> 34:33.654
Hey, I told you to fucking stop it.

34:36.699 --> 34:38.910
This crazy fucking asshole.

34:42.080 --> 34:42.955
Hey.

34:44.540 --> 34:45.625
Yeah, what?

34:45.708 --> 34:47.794
You son of a bitch.
We all came to help you.

34:50.338 --> 34:51.547
Yeon Si-eun is your friend,

34:54.133 --> 34:55.176
but we aren't?

35:02.350 --> 35:03.935
[breathing shakily]

35:13.653 --> 35:15.988
- I told you, didn't I?
- [Tae-hun] That's it.

35:16.072 --> 35:18.324
[Yeong-bin] I told you,
just learn your place!

35:18.407 --> 35:20.701
- You fucking bastard!
- [Jeong-chan] Ooh. I bet that stings.

35:20.785 --> 35:22.370
- [Tae-hun chuckles]
- [Si-eun groans]

35:22.453 --> 35:23.538
[melancholy music playing]

35:23.621 --> 35:26.207
- [Jeong-chan] Kick his fucking ass.
- [Tae-hun] Go in hard!

35:26.290 --> 35:27.917
[blows landing]

35:28.000 --> 35:30.461
- [Jeong-chan] You missed a spot!
- [boy 1] You son of a bitch!

35:30.545 --> 35:32.547
[laughter]

35:33.965 --> 35:35.675
[breathing shakily]

35:37.760 --> 35:39.762
[blows continue landing]

35:42.598 --> 35:44.600
[laughter]

35:45.268 --> 35:46.561
[Woo-yeong] Hey, Beom-seok.

35:51.941 --> 35:52.900
[laughter]

35:55.194 --> 35:57.029
Let's get another stream date set up.

35:57.530 --> 35:58.656
[Tae-hun] Dang!

35:58.739 --> 36:01.117
I told my hyeong-nims
I was fighting Ahn Su-ho.

36:05.830 --> 36:09.375
Today was a little bonus. Hm?
I need to get paid.

36:18.634 --> 36:21.637
- [whimpering]
- [Tae-hun] Fuck you.

36:21.721 --> 36:24.098
[Jeong-chan] You must've thought
we were fucking idiots. Dick.

36:24.182 --> 36:27.310
[Tae-hun] My chin still fucking hurts.
My chin. My chin! You shithead.

36:27.393 --> 36:29.979
- Keep stomping on this spitball.
- Shithead! [yells]

36:30.605 --> 36:32.023
You want some more?

36:34.275 --> 36:36.777
[boy 1] Hey!
That fucking bitch called the cops.

36:36.861 --> 36:39.614
- Hurry! Hey, hurry up!
- [Jeong-chan] Oh, fuck.

36:39.697 --> 36:41.115
- Come on, let's go!
- [Tae-hun] Shit!

36:41.199 --> 36:42.074
[boy 1] Hurry up!

36:43.868 --> 36:45.536
[footsteps receding]

36:49.957 --> 36:51.626
[music fades]

36:51.709 --> 36:53.586
[Yeong-bin chuckles]

36:54.795 --> 36:58.132
Hey, you thought you won, huh?

36:58.841 --> 37:00.593
[laughs]

37:24.158 --> 37:25.326
[sighs]

37:27.245 --> 37:28.579
Hey, Yeon Si-eun.

37:32.124 --> 37:33.334
Hey, Si-eun-a.

37:44.553 --> 37:46.555
[poignant music playing]

37:54.230 --> 37:55.439
[sighs]

37:57.191 --> 37:58.609
[shudders]

37:58.693 --> 38:00.444
[music fades]

38:02.530 --> 38:03.656
["Self" by Meego playing]

38:03.739 --> 38:06.492
♪ Swear to God… ♪

38:08.035 --> 38:09.870
[lyrics in Korean]

38:50.661 --> 38:54.332
♪ Yeah, oh, we better watch out ♪

38:54.415 --> 38:57.501
♪ We've nothing to lose ♪

38:57.585 --> 38:59.211
♪ For myself ♪

38:59.712 --> 39:02.465
♪ Yeah, right, for myself ♪

39:02.548 --> 39:09.180
♪ Yeah, right, oh
We're on the point of giving ♪

39:09.930 --> 39:14.810
♪ I still think we should stay here ♪

39:16.604 --> 39:20.775
♪ Take my hand… ♪

39:22.068 --> 39:24.070
[lyrics in Korean]

